Honesty, Integrity, Reliability, is what Jonathan and Aventura Real Estate, Inc. stand for. Miami Real Estate


In the Real Estate industry for over 30 years, Jonathan has been involved in the various trends of the fluctuating market. He is knowledgeable, experienced and dedicated to achieving the best deal for his clients.

Jonathan was born in Johannesburg, South Africa and emigrated to Israel where he served in the Israeli defense force. He attended University of Jerusalem and Florida International University with a major in marketing and business.  Jonathan is fluent in Hebrew and English. He began his Miami Real Estate career in property management, managing over a hundred residential units. He has been the Owner/Broker of Aventura Real Estate since 1993, which has been in the same location for over 35 years. With over 40+ active, full time agents, his office specializes in Residential ([http://Www.Thetimes.Co.uk/tto/public/sitesearch.do?querystring=Single%20Family|Single Family] homes and Condominiums), as well as Commercial Real Estate (Multi Family, Industrial and Business opportunities).

Jonathan’s expertise has allowed him to successfully close transactions in every aspect of real estate including multi-family, hotels/motels, commercial/business properties, as well as new construction condominiums and single family homes.

Jonathan’s office is multi-lingual, with agents speaking French, Russian, Portuguese, Spanish, Hebrew and English, of course.

If you want a Realtor to be your advocate, to work for you and to protect your best interests, consult Jonathan M. Lief at Aventura Real Estate, Inc.

